  "explanation": "Document 1 states that Donald Alexander Macdonald served as Lieutenant Governor of Ontario from 1875 to 1880, confirming this as a former position. Document 2 claims he held the position of procurador en Cortes, a member of the Cortes Españolas, from 1943 to 1977. However, this conflicts with the timeline in Document 1, which notes Macdonald died in 1896. Given this inconsistency, the claim in Document 2 appears historically implausible. Therefore, only the position of Lieutenant Governor of Ontario is supported by credible evidence."
}

